  "question": {
    "text": "The amplitude of magnetic field in an electromagnetic wave propagating along <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>. The maximum value of electric field in the electromagnetic wave is"
  },
